  message: "Stale-already-fixed by file-anchor:F1. Premise: tier classifier returns None for 100% of markdown nodes. Behavioral evidence (editable binary, /tmp/mddocs fixture): markdown kind=file anchors carry supply_chain.tier=1/first_party (non-None), and self-analysis shows 116/116 markdown file nodes with non-null tier. The default map represents markdown by classifiable kind=file anchors. (Any residual --include-docs section-kind nodes lacking a tier are default-noise-filtered and outside the item's stated 100%-None premise — a narrow peripheral surface, not this item.) Closing done."  # 6409
